[agent:result]   A monitor computes and monitors data or model quality metrics for a table over
[agent:result]   time. It generates metrics tables and a dashboard that you can use to monitor
[agent:result]   table health and set alerts. Most write operations require the user to be the
[agent:result]   owner of the table (or its parent schema or parent catalog). Viewing the
[agent:result]   dashboard, computed metrics, or monitor configuration only requires the user
[agent:result]   to have **SELECT** privileges on the table (along with **USE_SCHEMA** and
[agent:result]   **USE_CATALOG**).
